ConvexAnalysis — convex analysis and subdifferential calculus for Lean 4 / Mathlib

This package contains files ported from OptLib (https://github.com/optsuite/optlib),
Copyright the OptLib authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE). Ported from commit 5da27c5f95aa6a8a45b8c14b968ade4c13ff18c3
(2026-08-05), which targets Lean/Mathlib v4.13.0.

Modifications: the files under ConvexAnalysis/ were moved from the Optlib namespace
of modules to ConvexAnalysis, and their proofs were updated to compile with
Lean/Mathlib v4.33.1. Theorem names and statements are kept unless noted in
PORTING.md. The algorithm files of OptLib (ADMM, BCD, LASSO, Nesterov, gradient,
subgradient and proximal-gradient methods) are included under ConvexAnalysis/Algorithm.
